Upstream-Status: Not-applicable [Dakota ships no Red Hat release GPG key]
# Dakota has no /etc/pki/rpm-gpg/RPM-GPG-KEY-redhat-release, so these
# signedBy entries would reject every pull from the Red Hat registries.
# Without them those registries fall back to the docker "" default, as on
# every Dakota image to date.
# Exit: Drop if Dakota ships the Red Hat release key or common drops the entries.

